figures": {"status": "pass", "notes": "第5章：本轮62幅已有教学图语义未变；当前路径/来源/模板尺寸/图嵌入和全部表格对应检查PASS；当前章page-review绑定PNG归档，每个最终页实际观察或严格PNG同字节继承，无未观察新页。Word原生域与打印未测试。"}, "consistency": {"status": "pass", "notes": "第5章：当前源/图文稿相同，48节原题/顺序和第四至九章32个首小节位置核对；当前Word/PDF源码哈希、目录缓存/实际页、所有页图CRC/SHA一致；新增语义finding均已闭合，Parent保留第9章补充提案身份及旧run失效历史。"}}}}}, {"at": "2026-10-12T11:07:13.158746+00:00", "action": "accept", "state": "accepted", "details": {"scope": "chapter", "stage": "draft", "snapshot": {"AI时代的计算思维--跨界创新与终身学习能力培养-教材大纲.docx": "4b2526dd13a07ea1facaeefcef09658b9df46ab4496df6c782c8dc222967d8be", "AI时代的思维训练3.1节样稿.docx": "2fde276942f55dd4cfb00f0036a0d4a8935bd8320cef4c2eb0c47ed707e5aa17", "manuscripts/ch05-feedback-layout/ch05.md": "6e907d0610b85a710b4b4e5070b37b5bcc18ca77a12fe28778d52470c986d410", "十章编写蓝图.md": "524cb4604cccae6e8775e645ff1388bcf6d50a4ba70bbd45d76bfec9aaa3f84d", "assets/figures/ch05/fig5-1-gray.png": "b2c06947e897c0b015baa2af83cca37295e4f81e4f2807427670616031ff7ea7", "assets/figures/ch05/fig5-1.png": "dcff9227f3bb2bb947663034832187264f6d1ab17e719eabf341758dd89a8c61", "assets/figures/ch05/fig5-1.svg": "68ef731815fcf9418cf0608e7d0300ac9eb67282d2fb1ce061ee6682a3ef05dc", "assets/figures/ch05/fig5-2-gray.png": "a7b717cddd716cd5c689ac70bb29456de6bd39dc6fbd6ee3bb3eed8d358fa679", "assets/figures/ch05/fig5-2.png": "34194be5d956170dd9e360c6364558942d0507078480fbf7307c4799eae26d28", "assets/figures/ch05/fig5-2.svg": "2b79918e9889e125b5249796d3f455ec8ba40af2e0d0df14d9cbb16e384cd895", "assets/figures/ch05/fig5-3-gray.png": "68d2c2e416c098b4a91f51d34e39662db669ca2478e94b81230e25efd582e0bb", "assets/figures/ch05/fig5-3.png": "516814833220e5a8e2b4efa006a0d7cdc655c2c40bbbb053c5bfba11d49a8218", "assets/figures/ch05/fig5-3.svg": "995a701eee2edab96cf62922fa089f0ce33239c11bbf572411fa335bea6fc308", "assets/figures/ch05/fig5-4-gray.png": "55c92663a8be5bb3f243cfbe5a020ba4f7647b74f3115d6c3987ecfcdfac843b", "assets/figures/ch05/fig5-4.png": "404e32cbaf85e8f1555b84f1ae1f396b34af2a64fa622e5d18c2014e6da