399a8efff91d70fbd1d138df94c6df0946d4c57731d82fb965d3bb6ec696c7", "output/ch06-feedback/ch06-feedback.pdf": "0b696e5a8b61b2d9fa7e38be81c4c43cd5bbeed67f13017b69547bc09faed374", "output/outline-feedback/教材大纲-全国版.docx": "cbf0e000dca5581eafd7dd55e30d181f58f8df6f939b52f0bb088d5c459c0606", "output/outline-feedback/教材大纲-全国版.pdf": "e3f200e85bf98319a1deb86f04949dc510adaf7027df1882ecb64e1ffb9a6f18", "plans/ch06.plan.md": "69cec572c226560d3a2b4709f95bdd77c823910eef6734d2482de2e5ea121ffc", "plans/revision-feedback.plan.md": "ee3a5b910ff7bae5179e1e9300b754308362a96e7a89365c847d7946b3d30cdb", "skills/textbook-authoring/SKILL.md": "17a950d1c1fe7a14119cfaee4875ec18122ef71dd28ecc965150802845bb64a8", "skills/textbook-authoring/references/teaching-figures.md": "85a313cc70d3aeb432cc138709e90c4b781b0e01e44c484d103b425ddd9a9131", "specs/authoring-quality.spec.md": "7cdbcf21066722c66af4e890b71d4817ab824d57b4412e2144de750ddc12f7e2", "specs/ch06.spec.md": "77503ed300266795d174b72be9e6fccae74c17e9487a7199abbe635bf24bd479", "specs/revision-feedback.spec.md": "ea15a34002a97d7675640cc84665614516ec6fcc6c9ccff8e5655e3665992f2f", "templates/textbook-style-v1.0.dotx": "eef8ce505c3d9afb3493e61af1f38ee26bca6ff9a0aa12f7ad3e2a8cacad6473"}, "checks": {"teaching": {"status": "pass", "notes": "第6章：按当前Skill/增量Spec核对全国定位、原纲角色、基础路径和独立案例；七个变化章全文首审+定向闭合见专业/教学两个真实会话封存报告；第一/三/十章旧审读只按字节等价或明确小改继承。未声称学生/课堂验收。"}, "sources": {"status": "pass", "notes": "第6章：第二章原纲与三版全文mapping及一手论文逐项记录；第八章官方页面当前核对与受管来源窄审receipt已验证；模拟与真实边界由专业会话实际审读。其余未变出处沿用已核验原记录，不以品牌可访问推断全国可用。"}, "exercises": {"status": "pass", "notes": "第6章：实际独立内容审读及数值复算；第四章E07–10与集中参考解、E07口径/E08停止条件、第5章独立提示和第9章权重已实际复查闭合；第6章原型/测试实际运行，第8章UTF-8/CSV/TSV最小本地流程已演练。题号、数据和答案的当前排版检查通过。"}, "figures": {"status": "pass", "notes": "第6章：本轮62幅已有教学图语义未变；当前路径/来源/模板尺寸/图嵌入和全部表格对应检查PASS；当前章page-review绑定PNG归档，每个最终页实际观察或严格PNG同字节继承，无未观察新页。Word原生域与打印未测试。"}, "consistency": {"status": "pass", "notes": "第6章：当前源/图文稿相同，48节原题/顺序和第四至九章32个首小节位置核对；当前Word/PDF源码哈希、目录缓存/实际页、所有页图CRC/SHA一致；新增语义finding均已闭合，Parent保留第9章补充提案身份及旧run失效历史。"}}}}}, {"at": "2026-10-12T11:07:14.372630+00:00", "action": "accept", "state": "accepted", "details": {"scope": "chapter", "stage": "draft", "snapshot": {"AI时代的计算思维--跨界创新与终身学习能力培养-教材大纲.docx": "4b2526dd13a07ea1facaeefcef09658b9df46ab4496df6c782c8dc222967d8be", "AI时代的思维训练3.1节样稿.docx": "2fde276942f55dd4cfb00f0036a0d4a8935bd8320cef4c2eb0c47ed707e5aa17", "manuscripts/ch06-feedback-layout/ch06.md": "e590422011729a3bb24d45b509cc9fd72383ae1134fbec3eb21bc1fc081175aa", "十章编写蓝图.md": "524cb4604cccae6e8775e645ff1388bcf6d50a4ba70bbd45d76bfec9aaa3f84d", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-1-gray.png": "735fd2a36172a3b09219616c906733e8f35db2e3cfab79ed140a24ecdbd298ed", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-1.png": "0aa77fbc8d3fb46541429468545da6e814b830dd5a729e94259fdab461c7fe1c", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-1.svg": "99da35ec539d35c98bbc1d4dbed214617a03a28bd2913e00ed87568818e41edf", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-2-gray.png": "3785eb96be3f81bd797bc7514bf6e4b8b4d9d319f69e8b5011fba56645b71018", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-2.png": "a36d259ad4577d9b1d20a81b0082040ec0be6d9bddd6e43e775d2873b55e0921", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-2.svg": "17cc4895ed595e89a94d6b19ac92dda682e969513f3b551ba9ac11a223a8df5c", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-3-gray.png": "1496cc152a949cb4ef502d7d3fe18e005769dc8e86dad217bfe69e4465549e9b", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-3.png": "a93c7a4d2ca1c5776253197b06d241e814e3ed76868d20a7617918872555f8ac", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-3.svg": "e1bac1353c04912e560df084d0f9074345e3cfd0439e04d580f1127cff79296c", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-4-gray.png": "2740bece9686a88d9dba43c764b51e029d88bea4f5063a386a3f3df291c4f639", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-4.png": "5c662fbbb7c6082f79a10eedf8ba89e7a838e0ab4066a23c7f6c15b49c640f2c", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-4.svg": "bf5465e2e013234feacb5971e573fec6c97035beef733e981349d233821f8c56", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-5-gray.png": "c7948f807eb6a759eec11be88499bb31c660cb023c44ade1a51c50091f321928", "assets/figures/ch06/fig6-5.png": "5aaa6bc5702540a5899e5d015c3427f4bd810e69